Built with pasha CLI — **Modular Monolith** architecture on FastAPI.

## Stack

{{#if ormSqlalchemy}}- **ORM:** SQLAlchemy (async){{/if}}
{{#if ormTortoise}}- **ORM:** Tortoise ORM{{/if}}
{{#if ormNone}}- **Data layer:** in-memory repositories{{/if}}
{{#if hasDatabase}}- **Database:** {{database}}{{/if}}
{{#if hasValidation}}- **Validation:** Pydantic v2{{/if}}
{{#if useRedis}}- **Cache:** Redis{{/if}}
{{#if hasBroker}}- **Messaging:** {{broker}}{{/if}}

## Run

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
{{#if devRequirementsTxt}}
pip install -r dev-requirements.txt
{{/if}}

cp .env.example .env
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d
{{/if}}
uvicorn src.main:create_app --reload --factory --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

## Modules

{{#each modules}}
- `{{this}}` → `http://localhost:8000/{{this}}`
{{/each}}

## Structure

```
src/
├── main.py               ← uvicorn entry point
├── app.py                 ← FastAPI app factory (wires modules)
├── config/
│   └── settings.py        ← env loading
├── errors/
│   └── app_error.py       ← error classes
├── shared/
│   ├── database/          ← ORM setup
│   ├── cache/             ← Redis client
│   ├── auth/              ← JWT auth
│   └── health/            ← health check router
└── modules/<module>/
    ├── __init__.py             ← public API (exports router only)
    ├── <module>_entity.py      ← SQLAlchemy/Tortoise model
    ├── <module>_schema.py      ← Pydantic DTOs
    ├── <module>_repository.py  ← data access
    ├── <module>_service.py     ← business logic
    ├── <module>_router.py      ← FastAPI router
    └── <module>_test.py        ← pytest tests
```

